/ayah/37-112.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/37-112.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/37-112.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of As-Saaffaat 37:112 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"And We gave him good tidings of Isaac, a prophet from among the righteous.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/37.html\">Surah As-Saaffaat</a> › Verse 112</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah As-Saaffaat 37:112</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَبَشَّرْنَاهُ بِإِسْحَاقَ نَبِيًّا مِّنَ الصَّالِحِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">And We gave him good tidings of Isaac, a prophet from among the righteous.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فبين أنهما بشارتان: بشارة بالذبيح وبشارة ثانية بإسحاق وهذا بين.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 4/333</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s37a112\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/37-107.html\">Previous verse (37:107)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/37-147.html\">Next verse (37:147)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/37-147.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of As-Saaffaat 37:147 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"And We sent him to [his people of] a hundred thousand or more.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/37-147.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of As-Saaffaat 37:147 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"And We sent him to [his people of] a hundred thousand or more.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/37.html\">Surah As-Saaffaat</a> › Verse 147</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah As-Saaffaat 37:147</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَأَرْسَلْنَاهُ إِلَىٰ مِائَةِ أَلْفٍ أَوْ يَزِيدُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">And We sent him to [his people of] a hundred thousand or more.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">تحقيق لهذا العدد وأنهم لا ينقصون عن مائة ألف رجل واحدا<cite>«التبيان في أقسام القرآن» 1/250</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فذكر &quot; أو &quot; هاهنا كالتنصيص على حفظ المائة الألف، وأنها ليست مما أريد بها المبالغة، والله أعلم.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/326</cite></blockquote><h3>What he quoted from others</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «وفي الترمذي «أنه سئل - صلى الله عليه وسلم - عن قوله تعالى: {وأرسلناه إلى مائة ألف أو يزيدون} [الصافات: 147] كم كانت الزيادة؟ قال عشرة آلاف» .»<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 4/312</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s37a147\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/37-112.html\">Previous verse (37:112)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/37-156.html\">Next verse (37:156)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}